{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12999","headline":"喜辱韩十四郎中书兼封近诗示代书题赠 · 独孤及","name":"喜辱韩十四郎中书兼封近诗示代书题赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"各牵于役间游遨，独坐相思正郁陶。\n长跪读书心蹔缓，短章投我曲何高。\n宦情缘木知非愿，王事敦人敢告劳。\n所叹在官成远别，徒言岏水才容舠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}